title: "Halo — LLM Alignment Toolkit"
abstract: >-
  Halo is an open-source framework built by White Circle for training large
  language and multimodal models: pre-training and post-training (SFT, SMPO,
  GRPO, distillation, and more) with Expert, Context, Tensor, and Expert-Tensor
  Parallelism on top of the HuggingFace stack (TRL, Accelerate, Transformers).
